<p dir="auto" data-start="119" data-end="306">Treba ispraviti svih <strong data-start="140" data-end="154">8 datoteka</strong>: <code data-start="156" data-end="174">matinagrana.html</code>, <code data-start="176" data-end="197">matinagrana-en.html</code>, <code data-start="199" data-end="211">box2d.html</code>, <code data-start="213" data-end="228">box2d-en.html</code>, <code data-start="230" data-end="249">petrovagrana.html</code>, <code data-start="251" data-end="273">petrovagrana-en.html</code>, <code data-start="275" data-end="287">box2b.html</code> i <code data-start="290" data-end="305">box2b-en.html</code>.</p>
